# Auto-normalize line endings
* text=auto eol=lf

# Language detection: ensure GitHub displays 100% Rust
*.md linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation
models/** linguist-vendored
fonts/** linguist-vendored
Cargo.lock linguist-generated
Cargo.toml linguist-detectable=false
.gitignore linguist-detectable=false

*.rs linguist-detectable=true
